<title>CANADA: Canada agency details canola seed export quality.</title>
<headline>Canada agency details canola seed export quality.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Grain Commission on Monday detailed the quality specifications of canola seed destined for export.</p>
<p>			   CANOLA EXPORT QUALITY</p>
<p>Quality specification  Shipping Pd. No1 C  No2 C  No3 C Sample Dockage pct		Dec 1996     2.0    2.3    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>			  crop yr to date 2.0    2.1    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>			  prior crop yr   2.0    2.0    n/s   9.5</p>
<p>Moisture pct	     Dec 1996     8.5    8.8    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>			  crop yr to date 7.9    7.5    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>			  prior crop yr   7.2    7.5    n/s   8.3</p>
<p>Oil Content pct	  Dec 1996    43.1   44.8    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>(8.5% moisture basis)crp yr to date43.1   43.3    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>			   prior crop yr 42.9   43.1    n/s  38.7</p>
<p>Protein Content pct    Dec 1996    20.2   19.8    n/s   n/s</p>
<p>(8.5% moisture basis)crp yr to date20.0   19.7    n/s   n/s</p>
